{
  "name": "Call new GoHighLevel leads with a Ringee AI voice agent and update the opportunity",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GoHighLevel → AI call → opportunity\nA GoHighLevel workflow sends each new lead to n8n. An AI voice agent calls them and, when the call ends, the opportunity is marked **lost** if the person is not interested, or kept **open** with the AI's note.\n\n**Send leads here:** in GoHighLevel add a *Webhook* action that POSTs `{ \"name\": \"Ada Lovelace\", \"phone\": \"+14155550123\", \"email\": \"ada@example.com\", \"opportunityId\": \"opp_123\" }` to this workflow's webhook URL.\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f7bf12b9-dd85-5efc-8143-3086493c8134",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Before you run this**\n1. In Ringee, create a **Custom Integration** (Integrations → Custom Integrations) and copy its **API key** and **Signing Secret**.\n2. In n8n, create a **Ringee API** credential with both.\n3. Pick your AI voice agent in the Ringee node.\n4. Activate the workflow, then paste the **Ringee Trigger's Production URL** into the integration's **Outbound URL** and tick *Call Completed* and *Call Failed*.\n\nConnect **HighLevel** on the last node and choose the pipeline stage you want in *Update Fields*.\n\n**Protect the webhook.** The *New lead from GoHighLevel* node starts a paid call for whatever number it receives, so it requires authentication and will not activate until you choose a credential. In n8n create a **Header Auth** credential (any header name, for example `X-Webhook-Secret`, and a long random value), select it on that node, and make the GoHighLevel webhook action send the same header. Never share the URL without it.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "868e4cd0-5eb7-5a07-9889-5af718652bde",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Consent and calling hours**\nOnly call people who agreed to be called, and only at reasonable hours. Ringee blocks numbers on your Do-Not-Call list and respects your plan's limits, but you are responsible for the permission to call. Every phone number in this template is fictional.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "14e7e9ef-648d-5e6e-bde5-5167645113d8",
      "name": "Consent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        270,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ringee-ghl-lead",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "headerAuth"
      },
      "id": "4e77c7d8-e070-51c6-90e0-17bccc0e1d46",
      "name": "New lead from GoHighLevel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        270,
        -100
      ],
      "webhookId": "8c76a0ff-f9f8-50e8-8c77-4db862786bdf"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "aiAgent",
        "operation": "startCall",
        "agentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "phoneNumber": "={{ $json.body.phone }}",
        "variables": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "first_name": "={{ String($json.body.name || 'there').split(' ')[0] }}",
            "last_name": "={{ String($json.body.name || '').split(' ').slice(1).join(' ') }}",
            "email": "={{ $json.body.email || \"\" }}",
            "reason": "You asked for information through our website"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {
          "externalId": "={{ 'ghl-' + $json.body.opportunityId }}",
          "idempotencyKey": "={{ 'ghl-' + $json.body.opportunityId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "c9986427-a9f5-57bf-acc1-ed93a0bf6a0a",
      "name": "Start the call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        510,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "call.completed",
          "call.failed"
        ],
        "options": {
          "onlyAiAgentCalls": true,
          "externalIdPrefix": "ghl-"
        }
      },
      "id": "759f5c9e-c34c-5633-9f09-b2963403ace1",
      "name": "Call ended",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringeeTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        270,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "35d0862c-305c-57f7-976a-ce4a9ad8ca57"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 2,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "de687b10-231d-5ca5-8936-3292fb14736e",
      "name": "Wait for the AI analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        510,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "52ec7149-fbbd-51e1-9b16-74f8c10ba511"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "aiAgent",
        "operation": "getCallResult",
        "callId": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.call?.voiceAgentCall?.id || $('Call ended').item.json.data.agentCallId }}"
      },
      "id": "dcc559fe-faf0-5da7-b58e-f8b1129aa427",
      "name": "Get call result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        750,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "opportunity",
        "operation": "update",
        "opportunityId": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.externalId.replace('ghl-', '') }}",
        "updateFields": {
          "status": "={{ ['not_interested', 'wrong_number'].includes($json.outcome) ? 'lost' : 'open' }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "db0122bd-0750-526c-afcc-00cc21a46d3b",
      "name": "Update the opportunity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.highLevel",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        990,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "1a312479-b00d-5609-b280-97eabb5344ed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.outcome }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "8f79fa0f-d46e-59f8-89af-53fb37fa0139",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7c24517c-4d2f-521f-a92c-89442fe06c92",
      "name": "Analysis ready?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        990,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 5,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "e35854b5-5305-5fdf-92a5-412d22312b28",
      "name": "Wait 5 more minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        990,
        460
      ],
      "webhookId": "3578b82a-b95a-5aa2-8bd5-349ba9b3d941"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "aiAgent",
        "operation": "getCallResult",
        "callId": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.call?.voiceAgentCall?.id || $('Call ended').item.json.data.agentCallId }}"
      },
      "id": "04ef3a20-dff9-5284-8de4-e80adf7afd4e",
      "name": "Get call result (second try)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1230,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "47f428ab-b275-525d-8f7d-170d05827520",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.outcome }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "797d510e-b939-50d2-a328-66f6e5eef27c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ae0cd124-e7cf-5e4f-8f35-a1bba832a3cb",
      "name": "Ready now?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1470,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "71c7cd6a-d51d-582a-9db0-c981ccf13b50",
      "name": "Gave up: check the call in Ringee",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
